{
 "page_label": "Page 562",
 "lines": [
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "What was the screaming like? What was she saying?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Like help me.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "Did you know what was going on?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "(shakes head \u201cno\u201d) No.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "What did you do?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Well, I was going up to the, the driveway and get the mail.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "What time was that?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "\u2018bout four, four thirty",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "Was it light out?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Yeah. (nods \u201cyes\u201d)",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "OK.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "So you go out on your bike and you hear screaming coming from where?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "His house.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "Whose house?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Steven\u2019s.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "The house or the garage?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "The house.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "From the house.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "All right. Then what do you do?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "I just went to go get the mail and went in the house.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "So you go get the mail and you go in the house and then what?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
